  "title": "Yuri Gagarin, first human in space (Vostok 1)",
  "summary": "On 12 April 1961 Soviet cosmonaut Yuri Gagarin was launched from the Baikonur Cosmodrome in Vostok 1 and made one orbit of Earth in a flight of 108 minutes, becoming the first human in space. He ejected about 7 km up and parachuted down, landing near Engels in the Saratov region.",
